  "fullText": "We facilitate the growth of individuals and groups to create high-functioning teams.\n\nOUR MISSION\n\nGet a Coach\n\nDon’t just survive the storm—\nbecome a leader who reads the weather.\n\nRESPONSIVE\nCOACHING AND CONSULTING \n\nTO EQUIP LEADERS AND TEAMS WITH THE CULTURAL INTELLIGENCE TO MOVE QUICKLY, FOSTER INNOVATION, AND EXECUTE ON THEIR GOALS. \n\nTRANSFORMATIVE DEVELOPMENT\n\nWe work at every layer of your organization to unlock clarity, coherence, and sustained performance.\nSEE CLEARLY\nMOVE TOGETHER\n\nBringing hidden dynamics into view unlocks what high-growth teams need most: faster decisions, steadier leadership, and the ability to stay aligned, even in uncertainty.\n\nWhat are you building?\n\nCompanies\nPortfolios\nTogetherness that works\n\nWe facilitate the growth of individuals and groups to create high-functioning teams.\n\nGet Started\nNewsletter + Podcast\n\nWomens Retreat\n\nStories, insights, and new ideas from Heartwood. Get our monthly Newsletter, new podcast episodes and more by subsribing to Heartwood Collective on Substack. \n\nEvents\n\nVC Retreat\n\nFollow\n\nLinkedIn\n\nGet in touch\n\nhello@thehwc.com\n\nSubstack\n\nYoutube\n\nSelf-Transforming Teams\n\nHome\n\nThe Team\n\nFor Companies\n\nFor Investors\n\nTO TOP\n\nWe Respect your Privacy - Privacy Policy  | Data Processing Policy\n2025 Heartwood Collective, a part of Project Atlas LLC.\nCookie Preferences"
